  "system": {
    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>The bullet penetrates your foot, breaking some of the metatarsal bones before exiting through the sole of the foot, leaving an ugly hole that you fortunately don’t have to look at unless employing minor acrobatics.</p><p><strong>Effects:</strong> Your M is halved (round up) and you suffer a -20 penalty to your Agility, lasting until healed. For healing purposes it counts as a @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-core.items.Item.nF5z1OEhpi4t6a6S]{Torn Muscle (Minor)}.</p><p>No Extraction is necessary.</p>"
